linhas.en:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.
You've accumulated a lot of fatigue;
any more will be dangerous!

To attend high school, normally;
to go out into society, normally;
to grow old, normally.
Looking back at it now, that wish was nonsense, trivial.

―――Sorry, I'm afraid I have
no refreshments to offer;
I can't offer you a very warm welcome.
